Description: Oaxaca apt repository signing key
 The public key that signs the Oaxaca apt repository, installed to
 /etc/apt/keyrings/ so a sources entry can bind the repository to it.

Package: oaxaca-apt-source
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, oaxaca-archive-keyring
Description: Oaxaca apt repository sources entry
 The deb822 sources entry that points apt at the Oaxaca repository and
 binds it to the key from oaxaca-archive-keyring. Installed by the
 Oaxaca image builder; it is what makes the repository's own updates,
 including a changed repository location, reach installed systems.
